{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52303","headline":"诗（幷序） 六十四 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"造化成爲我，如人弄郭郎（「郎」字出韵，似当从《颜氏家训》作「郭秃」爲是）。\n魂魄似绳子，形骸若柳木。\n掣取细腰肢，抽牵动眉目。\n绳子作（张改作「乍」）断去，即是乾柳模。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}